cat("3. Check for homogeneity of dispersions (betadisper)\\n")
cat("4. Consider beta diversity components (turnover vs nestedness)\\n")
cat("\\nReference: Anderson & Walsh (2013) Ecol Monogr 83:557-574\\n")
